  "$id": "urn:hsvg:2.0:schema:capability:rich-text",
  "title": "HyperSVG 2.0 capability rich-text: Rich text",
  "description": "a rich-text binding through the draws door (D31): {\"target\": part, \"rich-text\": {\"runs\": [...]}} draws runs with named text styles, a highlight formula and optional runs; {\"rich-text\": {\"text\": ..., \"flow\": [parts]}} flows one text across an ordered list of drawn text parts (6.8.1) | text styles beyond the default strong and emphasis under addons.rich-text.styles of the experience or its kit, one list for every theme (7.7) | the content type richText (5.3.1): runs that use only the styles the field allows, per tier and per language; a form edits them with a small run editor (A6.1) | read-along: a run whose highlight is spoken lights while the spoken line says its words (6.11)",
  "$comment": "Generated by docs/spec-2.0-work/tools/schema/make-schemas.mjs from the spec/2.0 machine files. Do not edit.",
